{
  "title": "Ziyarate Janabe Hani ibn Urwah (a.s.)",
  "data": "سَلاَمُ اللّٰهِ الْعَظِیْمِ\nsalamu allahi al`azimi\nThe peace of Allah, the Great,\nوَصَلَوَاتُهٗ عَلَیْكَ یَا هَانِیْ ابْنُ عُرْوَۃَ\nwa salawatuhu `alayka ya hani bnu `urwata\nand His blessings be upon you, O Hani, son of `Urwah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْعَبْدُ الصَّالِحُ النَّاصِحُ لِلّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha al`abdu alssalihu alnnasihu lillahi\nPeace be upon you, O righteous servant, sincere counselor for Allah’s sake\nوَلِرَسُوْلِهٖ وَلِاَمِیْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ وَالْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَیْنِ عَلَیْهِمُ السَّلاَمُ\nwa lirasulihi wa li'amiri almu'minina wa alhasani wa alhusayni `alayhimu alssalamu\nand for His Messenger, and for the Commander of the Faithful, and al-Hasan and al-Husain, peace be upon them.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قُتْلِتَ مَظْلُوْماً\nashhadu annaka qutilta mazluman\nI bear witness that you were killed unjustly,\nفَلَعَنَ اللّٰهُ مَنْ قَتَلَكَ وَاسْتَحَلَّ دَمَكَ\nfala`ana allahu man qatalaka wastahalla damaka\nso may Allah curse whoever killed you and deemed your blood lawful to shed,\nوَحَشیٰ قُبُوْرَهُمْ نَاراً\nwa hasha quburahum naran\nand fill their graves with fire.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ لَقِیْتَ اللّٰهُ وَهُوَ رَاضٍ عَنْكَ\nashhadu annaka laqita allaha wa huwa radin `anka\nI bear witness that you met Allah while He was pleased with you\nبِمَا فَعَلْتَ وَنَصَحْتَ\nbima fa`alta wa nasahta\nfor what you did and the sincere counsel you gave.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْ بَلَغْتَ دَرَجَۃً الشُّهَدَائِ\nashhadu annaka qad balaghta darajata alshshuhada'i\nI bear witness that you attained the rank of the martyrs,\nوَجُعِلَ رُوْحُكَ مَعَ اَرْوَاحِ السُّعَدَائِ\nwa ju`ila ruhuka ma`a arwahi alssu`ada'i\nand your soul was placed among the souls of the fortunate ones,\nبِمَا نَصَحْتَ لِلّٰهِ وَلِرَسُوْلِهٖ مُجْتَهِداً\nbima nasahta lillahi wa lirasulihi mujtahidan\nfor the sincere, diligent counsel you gave for Allah and His Messenger,\nوَبَذَلْتَ نَفْسَكَ فِیْ ذَاتِ اللّٰهِ وَمَرْضَاتِهٖ\nwa badhalta nafsaka fi dhati allahi wa mardatihi\nand for giving your life for Allah’s sake and His good pleasure.\nفَرَحِمَكَ اللّٰهُ وَرَضِیَ عَنْكَ\nfarahimaka allahu wa radiya `anka\nMay Allah have mercy on you and be pleased with you,\nوَحَشَرَكَ مَعَ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهٖ الطَّاهِرِیْنَ\nwa hasharaka ma`a muhammadin wa alihi alttahirina\nand resurrect you with Muhammad and his purified family,\nوَجَمَعَنَا وَاِیَّاكُمْ مَعَهُمْ فِیْ دَارِ النَّعِیْمِ\nwa jama`ana wa iyyakum ma`ahum fi dari alna`imi\nand gather us and you together with them in the Abode of Bliss.\nوَسَلاَمٌ عَلَیْكَ وَرَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ۔\nwa salamun `alayka wa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\nAnd peace be upon you, and Allah’s mercy and blessings."
}
